<title>BELGIUM: EU boosts trade ties with Cambodia.</title>
<headline>EU boosts trade ties with Cambodia.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has signed a broad cooperation agreement with Cambodia which officials hope will help the Asian nation's reconstruction efforts.</p>
<p>Although the EU has given Cambodia substantial development aid in the past, officials said this was the first formal agreement with Phnom Penh on trade and economic cooperation.</p>
<p>The European Commission -- the EU's executive -- said the agreement would cover Cambodia's most-favoured nation trading status as well as cooperation in forrestry, rural development and environemntal protection.</p>
</text>
